{"title":"Car Jump Starters","description":"\u003ch1\u003eBuTure Jump Starters - Powerful Car Battery Boosters for All Engines\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuTure offers a selection of high-performance jump starters with peak currents.Suitable for all gas and diesel engines, our jump starters provide fast charging and smart safety features. Reliable and powerful, BuTure jump starters ensure you're never stranded. Shop now for your roadside safety! \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-br300","title":"Buture BR300 Portable Car Battery Jump Starter 1500A","description":"\u003cp\u003eA car battery jump starter can revive a dead battery and keep you moving when you need it most. With a powerful device like the Buture BR300, you can quickly get your vehicle running again, avoiding the hassle and potential danger of being stranded.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eA Powerful Jump Starter\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BR300 is equipped with a robust 1500 amps peak current, making it one of the best car jump starters available. It is capable of jump-starting 12V vehicles, including cars, SUVs, trucks, and vans with engines up to 7.0L gas or 5.5L diesel. This auto battery jump starter can start your vehicle in seconds, up to 20 times on a single charge. Its high performance ensures that you're never stranded due to a dead battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePortable Charger with Fast Output\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its jump-starting capabilities, the Buture BR300 also functions as a portable charger. It features fast output USB 1 with 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, and 12V\/1.5A, and USB 2 with 5V\/2.1A, ensuring the fastest charging efficiency for your devices. This means you can charge your smartphone, tablet, or other gadgets up to 4 times faster than with a conventional charger. The jump starter recharges fully in just 4 hours using the included USB C charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSafety Protection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSafety is a top priority with the Buture BR300. It comes with premium cells, circuitry, and safety features that protect you and your device from surges or short circuits. The smart safety jumper cable included with the jump starter ensures safe and foolproof connections, preventing any potential damage or mishaps during use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e4-IN-1 LED Flashlight\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture BR300 isn't just a car jump starter; it's also an essential emergency tool. It includes a built-in LED flashlight with four modes: Lighting, SOS, Strobe, and Warning. Whether you're dealing with a nighttime breakdown or need to signal for help, this versatile flashlight has got you covered.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat You Get\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you purchase the Buture BR300 Car Jump Starter, you receive a comprehensive package designed to meet all your needs:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eButure BR300 Car Jump Starter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB C Charging Cable (adapter not included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Jumper Clamps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 3 Years Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFriendly Customer Service\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .br300-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .br300-table th, .br300-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .br300-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .br300-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"br300-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1500\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e13800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e51.06\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e7.0L Gas\/5.5L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.3 x 3.0 x 8.8\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.44 kg (0.97 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/2.1A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: Lighting\/SOS\/Strobe\/Warning\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Jump Cable x1, Charging Cable x1, User Manual x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492445937919,"sku":"BR300","price":65.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-br300-car-jump-starter.jpg?v=1748254671"},{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta01","title":"Buture Beta01 Palm-Sized Jump Starter with Air Compressor丨3500A Peak Power, Auto Shut-Off Inflation","description":"\u003cp\u003eHaving a reliable jump starter with air compressor is essential for any car owner. The Buture Beta01 Portable Jump Starter Air Compressor is designed to meet all your emergency needs on the road. Combining a powerful 3500A jump starter with a 150PSI air compressor, this versatile device ensures you're prepared for any automotive challenge. Whether you need to jump-start your vehicle, inflate tires, or charge your electronic devices, the Buture Beta01 provides a compact, multi-functional solution that you can rely on, making it an indispensable tool for your vehicle.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Beta01 Jump Starter with Air Compressor Can Do\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e1. High Efficient Battery 3500A Jump Starter\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQDSP Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e The Buture Beta01 car jump starter and air compressor incorporates advanced QDSP (Quick Discharge Start Power) technology, providing 3-5 times the current of traditional jump starters with the same capacity. This ensures powerful and reliable performance, capable of jump-starting 12V vehicles, including those with up to 8.5L gas or 8.0L diesel engines, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -20℃~60℃ (-4℉~140℉).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e With a peak current of 3500A, the Beta01 can instantly restart a wide range of vehicles. Whether dealing with a dead battery in harsh winter or hot summer conditions, the Beta01 ensures your vehicle starts quickly and reliably.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting and Reliable: \u003c\/strong\u003eThis car jump starter supports over 1000 recharge cycles, providing long-term reliability. Its high-capacity battery ensures multiple jump-starts on a single charge, making it an essential tool for emergencies.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUser-Friendly Design: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe Beta01 includes intuitive features for easy operation. It is equipped with 10 layers of safety protection, ensuring safe use for both you and your vehicle, preventing potential risks during operation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eSimple Steps to Start Your Car:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInsert Clamps:\u003c\/strong\u003e Insert the clamp plug completely into the Beta01. The red and green indicators will flash alternately.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnect Clamps:\u003c\/strong\u003e Connect the red clamp to the positive terminal (+) of your vehicle battery and the black clamp to the negative terminal (-). The green indicators will become solid.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStart the Car: \u003c\/strong\u003eStart your car. If the engine does not start on the first attempt, disconnect the clamps, wait for at least 30 seconds, and try again.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRemove Clamps: \u003c\/strong\u003eOnce the vehicle is started, remove the jumper cables from the battery within 30 seconds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e2. Advanced Air Compressor\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eHigh Performance\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe built-in air compressor boasts a maximum pressure of 150PSI, making it ideal for inflating car tires, sports equipment, and other inflatables quickly and efficiently.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTurbocharged Inflation\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a turbocharged inflation rate of 35L\/Min, this jump starter with air compressor can run continuously for up to 25 minutes, providing fast and reliable inflation for all your needs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eSmart Design\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeta01 jump box with air compressor is designed with user convenience in mind. It features a smart preset function and an auto shut-off feature to prevent over-inflation. The LCD display offers real-time data on air pressure, making it easy to monitor and adjust as needed. You can easily switch between pressure units (BAR, KPA, PSI) using the unit button.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eDetachable Air Hose\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe detachable extended air hose enhances flexibility and convenience during use, allowing you to reach difficult spots with ease. This makes inflating tires and other items straightforward and efficient.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eEasy Operation:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 1:\u003c\/strong\u003e Connect the air hose firmly to the product and the tire air valve, then press down the handle to secure the hose.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 2: \u003c\/strong\u003eShort press the power button to activate the product, then press the pump button to switch to pumping mode (default set to 2.5Bar). Adjust the pressure using the \"+\" and \"-\" buttons, and switch between units (BAR, KPA, PSI) using the unit button.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 3: \u003c\/strong\u003eAfter setting the desired pressure, press the power button to start the pump. The real-time tire air pressure will be displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 4: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe product will automatically shut off once the pre-set pressure is reached, ensuring precise inflation without the risk of over-inflation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSafety Tip: \u003c\/strong\u003eFor prolonged use, it is recommended to stop the inflator every 10 minutes to allow it to cool down, preventing overheating and ensuring optimal performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e3. LED Emergency Light\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Mode Lighting: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe Buture Beta01 includes a powerful LED light with three modes: a steady white light for general illumination, a strobe light for attention-grabbing signals, and an SOS mode for emergency situations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe LED light can operate continuously for up to 48 hours, providing reliable lighting in dark or low-visibility conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Operation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the LED button for 3 seconds to turn on the white flashlight. Short press to switch between Strobe and SOS modes, and press again to turn off. This makes it versatile and essential for roadside emergencies and outdoor activities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e4. Portable Power Bank\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMultiple Outputs: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe Beta01 is equipped with dual USB outputs (5V\/2.4A each), allowing you to charge two devices simultaneously. This ensures that you can keep your electronic devices powered up on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupporting Devices: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe power bank function supports a wide range of devices, including smartphones, tablets, cameras, and other USB-powered electronics. This makes it a convenient tool for daily use and during travels.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Capacity: \u003c\/strong\u003eWith a 20000mAh battery capacity, the Beta01 can provide multiple charges to your devices, ensuring you stay connected even in remote locations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Beta01 as Your Jump Starter with Air Compressor\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eComprehensive Safety\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Beta01 includes 10 layers of safety protection to ensure safe operation. These protections include reverse polarity, short circuit, overcharge, over-discharge, over-temperature, low voltage, high voltage, anti-spark, overload, and over-current protections. These built-in safety features ensure safe use for both you and your vehicle, preventing potential risks during operation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDurability\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Beta01 is designed with a unique honeycomb thermal structure that effectively reduces start-up temperature. Its high-temperature resistant casing further enhances the product's durability, ensuring stable operation even under extreme conditions. Whether you accidentally drop it or it bounces around in your car on rough roads, the Beta01 is built to withstand these challenges. The robust construction and high-quality materials ensure reliable performance, making it a dependable tool no matter where you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eVersatility\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta01 is not just a jump starter; the integrated 150PSI air compressor, LED emergency light with three modes, and dual USB power bank make the Beta01 a multi-functional tool for various emergencies.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003ePortability\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDespite its powerful capabilities, the Beta01 is compact and lightweight, making it easy to carry and store. Its design ensures that you can take it on the go, making it a perfect companion for road trips and emergency situations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eConvenient Tool Box\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo enhance your experience, we provide a sturdy and stylish tool box that can comfortably hold the Beta01 jump starter and its accessories. This makes it incredibly convenient to carry everything you need, keeping your jump starter with air compressor and accessories organized and protected, and ensuring you are always prepared for any situation while on the road.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eCustomer Support\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy peace of mind with a 12-month warranty and lifetime technical support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure Beta01 Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta01-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta01-table th, .beta01-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta01-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta01-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta01-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e3500\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e20000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e8.5L Gas\/8.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e10.7 x 4.9 x 4.3\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1.43 kg (3.15 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-20℃~60℃ (-4℉~140℉).\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1\/2: 5V\/2.4A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBright LED flashlight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e3 Modes: Always on\/SOS\/Strobe\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMaximum Air Pressure\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e150 PSI\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePacking List\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1. Portable Jump Starter\u003cbr\u003e2. jumper cables and Heavy Duty Smart Clamp\u003cbr\u003e3. Detachable Extended Air Hose\u003cbr\u003e4. USB C Charging Cable\u003cbr\u003e5. Valve Connector*3\u003cbr\u003e6. Premium EVA Protection Case\u003cbr\u003e7. Instruction Manual\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492328857855,"sku":"Beta01","price":89.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta01-car-jump-starter.jpg?v=1748248782"},{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta02","title":"Buture Beta02 Car Jump Starter 2500A Peak丨21800mAh Power Bank, Lightweight Design","description":"\u003cp\u003eExtended inactivity or severe weather can drain your battery. Avoid the hassle of a dead battery by investing in a high-quality battery jump box like the Buture Beta02. Whether you're a seasoned driver or new to vehicle maintenance, a dependable battery jump box is crucial. Automotive owners agree that a good battery jump box can save you from unexpected breakdowns and costly towing services.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh-Efficient Battery Jump Starter\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta02 Car Battery Jump Starter utilizes the latest QDSP technology, providing 3-5 times the current of traditional jump starters with the same capacity. With a powerful 2500A battery pack and a capacity of 21800mAh, this jump starter can instantly restart 12V dead vehicles with up to 8.5L gas or 8.0L diesel engines in just seconds, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -4℉ to 140℉ (-20℃ to 60℃). It supports over 1000 recharge cycles, making it a more convenient option than relying on another car or roadside assistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBackup Battery Charger Power Bank\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with two quick charge ports, the Buture Beta02 serves as a reliable power bank, capable of rapidly charging your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices. The USB-C port outputs 5V\/2A, while the two additional USB ports offer 5V\/2.4A and 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A respectively. Thanks to its low self-discharge rate, this battery jump starter can remain on standby for up to 24 months, ensuring you always have backup power and peace of mind during your travels.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEmergency Flashlights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeaturing a large luminous area, the Beta02 includes a bright LED flashlight with four modes: 600 Lumens Lighting, Strobe, Orange Strobe, and SOS. The flashlight can operate continuously for up to 48 hours, making it an invaluable tool in emergencies or on adventurous trips. This portable car battery jump box is designed to help you navigate unexpected situations with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Large Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe large LCD display on the Buture Beta02 provides clear visibility of the jump pack's operational status and battery power. Its integrated screen design offers a modern, concise look, while the rainproof and dustproof features ensure durability in outdoor conditions. The metal texture edge enhances the overall robustness of the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePremium Protection \u0026amp; Extended Jumper Cables\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe patented German extended jumper cable kit included with the Beta02 features an independent informative LCD screen that displays detailed voltage and potential errors in real-time. The jump starter automatically runs 10 upgraded protections, balancing extreme temperatures and utilizing advanced battery technology to ensure safe and reliable car starts. The smart clamps, USB C cable, and EVA case are included in the package for added convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHassle-free Service\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe strive to provide a seamless experience, but if you ever need assistance, our service team is ready to help. The Buture Beta02 Car Battery Jump Starter comes with a worry-free 24-month warranty and lifetime technical support, ensuring you receive the help you need whenever you need it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n        border=\"1\"\n    \u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta02-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta02-table th, .beta02-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta02-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta02-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 99.9282%; height: 352.644px;\" class=\"beta02-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003ePeak Current\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e2500A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eBattery Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e21800mAh\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eEnergy\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e80.66Wh\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eEngine Compatibility\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e8.5L Gas \/ 8.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eDimensions\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e10.2 x 5.1 x 3.7 inches\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e1.04 kg (2.29 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eOperating Temperature\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e-4℉ to 140℉ (-20℃ to 60℃)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eUSB-C Port\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e5V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 39.1827px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eUSB Ports\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 39.1827px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eFlashlight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003e4 modes: 600 Lumens Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eYes (large)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 58.774px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 58.774px;\"\u003eIncluded Accessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 58.774px;\"\u003eSmart Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492407173375,"sku":"Beta02","price":69.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta02-car-jump-starter.jpg?v=1748247944"},{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta03","title":"Buture Beta03 Car Battery Jump Starter 5000A丨400 Lumen Wide Angle Light, Built in Compass","description":"\u003cp\u003eA car without a working battery is like a heart without a beat – essential and irreplaceable. Whether you're jump-starting a dead battery or maintaining one in a rarely driven vehicle, having a car battery booster is crucial. Enter the Buture Beta03, a powerhouse in the world of car battery boosters. This remarkable device is designed to effortlessly jump-start any vehicle, from gasoline to 10.0L diesel engines. With its smart clamps connecting to your battery's terminals, the Beta03 swiftly breathes life back into your car. Discover why the Buture Beta03 is a game-changer and one of the best car battery jumpers you can find.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful Emergency Starter for Automobiles\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta03 is engineered to handle any situation with ease. Its 5000A peak current ensures it can start any 12V vehicle, including hybrids, in mere seconds. The forced start function provides a double guarantee, enabling the battery pack to jump-start low voltage and severely drained batteries immediately, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -4°F to 140°F. This car battery jumper is designed to provide you with peace of mind, no matter the weather.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh Capacity Power Bank \u0026amp; DC Power Supply\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond jump-starting your vehicle, the Buture Beta03 also serves as a high-capacity power bank. With a 26800mAh battery, it can quickly charge your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices through its dual USB ports, which are 75% faster than standard chargers. Additionally, it includes a DC cigarette lighter, allowing you to power car accessories like air pumps and vacuum cleaners. This portable battery jump starter can remain on standby for about 24 months, ensuring it's always ready when you need it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMulti-functional Emergency Tool\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta03 is more than just a car battery jumper; it's a multi-functional emergency tool. It features a built-in flashlight with four modes: white super bright, orange SOS, and white strobe light, providing maximum convenience and flexibility at night. The flashlight can last for 48 hours, making it perfect for camping, traveling, and emergencies. Additionally, the device comes equipped with an accurate compass, ensuring you'll never get lost again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVisual Large Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe large, visualized LCD screen on the Buture Beta03 allows you to monitor the battery level, output current, and voltage at a glance. Its ruggedized case makes it waterproof, dustproof, and drop-proof, ensuring durability in any environment. The compact size and included carrying case make it easy to store and transport, making this car battery booster a reliable companion on the road.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCommitted to Safety\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSafety is a top priority with the Buture Beta03. This car battery jumper box is equipped with excellent conductivity and smart jumper kits that automatically run 10 protections to safeguard against short circuits, sparks, and other potential hazards. This ensures that you and your vehicle are protected every time you use the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta03-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta03-table th, .beta03-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta03-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta03-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta03-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e26800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e99.16\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/10.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.1 x 3.9 x 9.1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1.18 kg (2.60 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A, 9V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/2.4A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with EC5)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (smart clamps)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (large)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompass\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eEC5 Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492414251263,"sku":"Beta03","price":109.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta03-car-jump-starter.webp?v=1748247032"},{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta04","title":"Buture Beta04 Heavy Duty Car Jump Starter 6000A丨27000mAh Battery, 65W Two-Way Fast Charge","description":"\u003cp\u003eImagine driving through the remote stretches of the Arizona desert when your car battery suddenly dies, leaving you miles away from the nearest help. In this situation, having the Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter in your trunk can make all the difference. This compact device can jump-start your car quickly, ensuring you’re not stranded for long.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Cars Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter Supports?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for jump-starting flat car batteries, Buture portable Beta04 supports a wide range of vehicles, including:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLawn Mowers: Up to 1.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotorcycles: Up to 3.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCars and SUVs: Up to 6.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTrucks: Up to 9.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeavy-Duty Trucks: Up to 12.5L engines.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith an impressive 99% success rate and virtually zero errors, this top-rated portable car jump starter from the Buture Store delivers reliable performance for a variety of engine sizes and types.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBesides, another reason you may want to choose the Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter is that it operates reliably in temperatures ranging from -20℃ to 60℃ (-4℉ to 140℉), ensuring your vehicle can be jump-started year-round, regardless of weather conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHow to Start Your Car\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eStep-by-Step Instructions\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003col style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect Cables: Red clamp to positive (+), black clamp to negative (-).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheck Indicator: Wait for the indicator sign on the screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStart Engine: Start your car.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUsing the Force Start Function\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Force Start Function is necessary when the screen doesn’t display anything after connecting the clamps. This situation can occur if the car battery is completely dead or if there is a false short circuit alarm, preventing the automatic detection system from recognizing a proper connection. The Force Start Function overrides this issue by providing a direct boost of power to the battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePress Button: Hold the force start button for 5 seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheck Screen: Ensure the two signs appear on the screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStart Engine: Start your car.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning: \u003c\/strong\u003eWhen using the Force Start Function, auto-detection and safety features will be disabled. This means the device will not automatically detect issues like reverse polarity or short circuits, so extra caution is required.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eThe Safety Features During Starting Your Car\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eBuilt-In Protections\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReverse connection protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOverheat protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow voltage protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShort circuit protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdditional Safety Features\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTimeout protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow and high-temperature protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eUser-Friendly Warnings\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta04 Portable Car Jump Starter features a comprehensive 3.3-inch smart display that provides clear and intuitive indicators to help you troubleshoot any issues during the jump-start process.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBeta04 Car Jump Starter Highly Recommended Portable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMulti-Functionality:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower Bank:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 27000mAh Li-on battery to readily charge multiple devices, including phones, MacBooks, and laptops.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures 65W USB-C, 160W DC out, and 2x18W USB ports for versatile charging options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmergency Lighting:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 modes lights for different emergencies and can double as a warning triangle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdated 600 lumens LED lights with a larger luminous area and 300° wide-angle irradiation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProvides 400%+ brightness and can be used continuously for 96 hours, outperforming counterparts and enhancing safety.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eCompact Size:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 9 x 3.5 x 1.5 inches.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasily fits in your trunk or glove compartment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeighs just 2.5 pounds, making it easy to carry and handle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDurability:\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComes with a sturdy case that holds the jump starter and accessories.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRobust design protects against drops, dust, and rain, ensuring longevity and reliable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing a Portable Car Jump Starter offers numerous advantages. It provides convenience and independence by eliminating the need for another vehicle or roadside assistance, allowing for quick and easy use. Its versatility enables it to jump-start various vehicles and charge electronic devices. Essential for emergency preparedness, especially in remote areas or during long trips, it ensures you are always ready for unexpected situations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure Beta04 Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta04-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta04-table th, .beta04-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta04-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta04-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta04-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e6000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e27000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e99.9\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/12.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.1 x 3.9 x 10.4\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.950 kg\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 65W Max\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1\/2: 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003cbr\u003eDC: 12-16V\/10A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with DC)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4 modes: 600 Lumens Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (product)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (3.3\" color)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eEC6 Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C to USB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB to USB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eDC Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492418838783,"sku":"Beta04","price":109.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta04-car-jump-starter.webp?v=1748245233"},{"product_id":"buture-jump-starter-beta05","title":"Buture Beta05 Car Jump Starter 4000A丨EC5 Adapter Included, Power More Devices","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you've ever walked out to your car and found a dead battery, you know how crucial it is to have a car battery starter on hand. Nobody has time to wait for roadside assistance or hope for a jumpstart from a good Samaritan. That's why investing in a reliable car battery starter like the Buture Beta05 is essential for peace of mind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned to handle all gasoline and 10.0L diesel engines, this versatile car battery starter is a must-have for anyone who wants peace of mind on their journeys.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh Efficient Battery Jump Starter\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta05 utilizes the latest QDSP technology, providing 3-5 times the current of traditional jump starters with the same capacity. With a boosted 4000A peak current, this powerful car battery booster can instantly restart 12V dead vehicles, including all gas and 10.0L diesel engines, even in extreme temperatures ranging from -4℉ to 140℉ (-20℃ to 60℃). Supporting more than 1000 recharge cycles, it offers a more convenient and reliable option compared to using another car or roadside service.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBackup Battery Charger Power Bank\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture Beta05 doesn't just jump-start your car; it also serves as a high-capacity power bank. With a 23800mAh battery, it can quickly charge your cell phones, tablets, and other USB devices through its dual USB ports. These ports include USB 1 (5V\/2.4A) and USB 2 (5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A). Additionally, it includes a DC cigarette lighter, allowing you to power car accessories like air pumps and vacuum cleaners. This portable battery jump starter can remain on standby for about 24 months, ensuring you're always backed up with power when you need it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEmergency Flashlights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis car battery jumper features a bright LED flashlight with three modes: large lighting, strobe, and orange strobe\/SOS. The larger luminous area provides ample light, making it an invaluable tool in emergencies or on adventure trips. The flashlight can operate continuously for up to 48 hours, ensuring you always have a reliable light source in any situation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Large Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 5\" LCD display on the Buture Beta05 provides clear and concise information about the jump pack's operational status and battery power. The integrated screen design is both modern and functional, featuring rainproof and dustproof capabilities to ensure durability in outdoor conditions. The metal texture edge adds to its durability, making it a reliable companion for any journey.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHassle-free Service\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Buture, customer satisfaction is a priority. The Beta05 car battery starter comes with a worry-free 36-month warranty and lifetime technical support. Our friendly and efficient service team is always ready to assist you, ensuring that you have the best experience possible with your car battery booster.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure Beta05 Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .beta05-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .beta05-table th, .beta05-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .beta05-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .beta05-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"beta05-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePeak Current (A)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4000\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (mAh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e23800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity (Wh)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e88.06\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCompatible Vehicle Types\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAll Gas\/10.0L Diesel\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Dimensions (inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e9.1 x 5.1 x 3.7\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1.11 kg (2.45 lbs)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOperating Temperature Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e-4℉~140℉\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB-C: 5V\/2A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUSB 1: 5V\/2.4A\u003cbr\u003eUSB 2: 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSupports DC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (160W MAX with EC5)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLight Modes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e3 modes: Large Lighting\/Strobe\/Orange Strobe\/SOS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eForced Start\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (smart clamps)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDisplay Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes (large)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAccessories\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSmart Clamps x1\u003cbr\u003eEC5 Adapter x1\u003cbr\u003eUSB C Cable x1\u003cbr\u003eEVA Case x1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492423033087,"sku":"Beta05","price":89.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-jump-starter-beta05.jpg?v=1748244136"},{"product_id":"buture-beta06-jump-starter","title":"Buture Beta06 5000A Jump Starter with Tire Inflator丨23800mAh Long Standby, 160W DC Output","description":"\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;userData\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;4625381305\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;mbrz8ko1yhwvryygy8e\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;fold\u0026quot;:false}}}},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8kniguaxgxut7bj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Buture Beta06 High-Power Car Jump Starter\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knj5k6nz26452g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;4000A Peak Current | 150PSI Air Compressor | Power Bank | Emergency Light\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knkw52zokfp1qk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Be prepared for anything on the road. The Buture Beta06 Car Jump Starter is an all-in-one emergency powerhouse that combines a 4000A high-peak jump starter, a 150PSI air compressor, an emergency LED light, and a 23,800mAh power bank—making it the ultimate roadside companion for every driver. Whether you're facing a dead battery, flat tire, or low phone charge, the Beta06 Jump Starter has your back.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knkxqx3bexqyxm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;💥 Unmatched Jump Starting Power\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knk739ak99yln9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Start Any 12V Vehicle with Confidence\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knlazp9q2jh5rr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;4000A Peak Current instantly jump-starts all gas engines or up to 10L diesel vehicles — even with completely dead batteries.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knln183ocp8wbe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Equipped with one-button forced start technology, ensuring success in extreme conditions from -20°C (-4°F) to 60°C (140°F).\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knlpbs2g048dr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Perfect for cars, trucks, motorcycles, boats, ATVs, RVs, and more.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbss4wqs7ychcuvoeqg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Built to Last — Reliable Performance, Every Time\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbss50qpja5eiy1l9ym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Buture Beta06 Car Jump Starter is engineered for long-term durability and consistent performance, delivering over 1,000 reliable jump-start cycles throughout its lifespan. Designed with 10 layers of advanced safety protection, including safeguards against reverse polarity, short circuits, overcharge, overcurrent, and overheating, it ensures safe operation for both you and your vehicle. Whether you're facing an emergency or performing routine use, the Beta06 Jump Starter offers unmatched reliability and peace of mind every time you hit the road.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knmbvb32b80tnw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;💨 High-Efficiency Cordless Air Compressor\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knmk4dgxjpcp6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Super-Pressure Inflator — Up to 150PSI Output\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knnwy6bi6cp5l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Buture Beta06 is more than just a jump starter — it's a fully capable high-pressure air compressor that delivers up to 150 PSI, making it ideal for inflating car tires, bicycles, motorcycle tires, sports balls, and other inflatables. Whether you're topping off pressure before a long drive or dealing with a flat tire on the road, the Beta06 Jump Starter ensures you're covered in minutes.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knnw0xgz4bv0i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Turbocharged Inflation Speed — 35L\/Min Airflow\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knpldfa7oaqw6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Thanks to its turbocharged inflation rate of 35 liters per minute, this air compressor significantly reduces wait times. A standard car tire can be fully inflated in just a few minutes. Designed for continuous operation up to 25 minutes, it provides stable, reliable inflation even for larger or multiple tiresperfect for roadside emergencies or outdoor tasks.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knps4qui8843g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Smart Preset Function — Inflate Without Worry\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knqgnw8x0mgo3r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Beta06 Car Jump Starter features an intelligent preset pressure system that automatically stops inflation when the target PSI is reached. This eliminates the risk of over-inflation and ensures optimal safety and efficiency with every use. Whether you're inflating car tires or sports gear, just set it and let the device do the rest.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knqii6r8f0cums\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Easy-to-Read LCD Display \u0026amp; Unit Switching\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knqpixa2gha4q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Stay in control with the bright, backlit LCD screen that shows real-time air pressure and battery status. Effortlessly switch between PSI, BAR, and KPA with a single button to match your preferred units or regional standards. This smart interface makes the Buture Beta06 Jump Starter easy to use for beginners and professionals alike.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knqdi1441s3dv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;🔦 Emergency LED Lighting — Be Ready Anytime\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knrvv9t1knb1sn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;3-in-1 Multi-Mode LED Light\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knrkjn9rwivhzn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Buture Beta06 Car Jump Starter is equipped with a powerful built-in emergency LED light featuring three versatile modes to support a variety of roadside or outdoor situations:\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knr519004bsmt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Flashlight Mode — Ideal for nighttime car repairs, campsite lighting, or 