er the long term. Its durable lithium battery ensures that you're never left without backup power when you need it most — making it an essential addition to any vehicle emergency kit.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knwm78qqfeb44\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;spacing\u0026quot;:{},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;🛡️ Built with Safety \u0026amp; Durability in Mind\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knwu2najh9rym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Advanced 10-in-1 Protection System\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knx6bgrkl5hab8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;The Beta06 Car Jump Starter is equipped with an intelligent 10-layer safety protection system, offering full defense against reverse polarity, short-circuit, overcharge, overcurrent, overheating, and more. Whether you're jump-starting a car or inflating a tire, you can operate the device with confidence and peace of mind every time.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbrz8knyqsab6hyfegd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;ind\u0026quot;:{\u0026quot;left\u0026quot;:0},\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026q