signal, orange strobe, and warning light — up to 48 hours runtime on a single charge.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u4lr7295uln1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Long-lasting Modern Design\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u4ohisjjnc2t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Large Informative Display: Features a 3.3 inch high-contrast digital display, easy-to-read even in harsh sunlight. Learn the operational status, battery level and possible errors at a glance.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u4a2vpx91s5qw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Extreme Durability: Performs reliably from -20°C to 60°C, making it ideal for extreme cold or hot conditions.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u44eo9xjdukee\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Smart and Compact: Palm-sized design (1.5lbs) with intuitive one-button controls, which makes it portable in your car emergency kit, glove box, or even bag. \u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u593f7f6f0l7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Comprehensive Safety Features \u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u5zu8nb1er46\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Buture Beta07 Portable Car Jump Starter is very safe and easy to use. The all-metal jumper clamps are designed to be sturdy and durable, it provides versatile protection systems, without the worry of incorrect connections or sparks. \u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u5zjr33owh0d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Advanced Protection: Equipped with 10 safety layers to guard against reverse polarity, overcurrent, overvoltage, short circuits, and more, ensures risk-free operation.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u5m8xwa47ihrf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Essential Safety Gear: Comes with 400V insulated gloves and a rugged EVA case — perfect for night-time roadside repairs or emergencies.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u5tjpl7013ksl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;What You Get\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u5inq8fwcqukc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Buture Beta07 Jump Starter made of rugged material, waterproof, dustproof and drop-proof, can prevent damage from rain, dust, and external shocks, making it suitable for use in various complex work scenarios. The package includes a Beta07 Jump Starter×1, Heavy Duty Smart Clamp×1, Detachable Air Hose×1, USB\u0026amp;USB-C Charging Cable×2, Insulated Gloves×1, Valve Connectors×3, EVA Protection Case×1, and User Manual×1.\u0026quot;]]],[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;mbry05u553nfqk3vbxb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Power Your \\\u0026quot;Road Life\\\u0026quot;: Grab the Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter — Where Power Meets Precision. Never Fear a Flat Battery or Flat Tire Again! \u0026quot;]]]]\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta07 Car Jump Starter with Air Compressor — The Ultimate 10-in-1 Emergency Power Station\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhen you're on the road, peace of mind comes from knowing you're prepared for anything. Introducing the Buture Beta07 — a powerful and compact 10-in-1 roadside companion designed to handle every emergency with ease. From jump-starting a dead battery to inflating tires or charging your devices, the Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter is engineered to be your all-in-one travel essential.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eMulti-Function Travel Tool\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e6000A Powerful Start — Bring Car Batteries Back to Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Revival: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter provides up to 6000A peak current, it can start most kinds of vehicle, including cars, trucks, motorcycles, boats, RVs, tractors, and more in just a few seconds, only needs 3 steps. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForce Start Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e The Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter with heavy-duty clamps and cables \u003c\/span\u003einstantly jump-start all gasoline engines and up to 12.0L diesel engines, even if the battery is completely dead (0V).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e160PSI Turbo Air Compressor — Fast Inflation in Minutes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Speed Output:\u003c\/strong\u003e Inflate a flat car tire to 25 PSI in just 2 minutes with a 45L\/min turbo inflator.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrecision Control: \u003c\/strong\u003eSet your target pressure from 5 preset modes (up to 160PSI), 4 units (PSI\/BAR\/KPA\/KG), with ±1 PSI accuracy.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Shutoff: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe pump stops automatically when reached — no risk of over-inflation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e26800mAh Power Bank — Charge Devices Devices On the Go\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eYou can use the Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter as a 26800mAh\/99.16Wh power bank. It designed with 2 USB outputs and 1 USB-C Input\/Output. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBi-Directional PD45W: \u003c\/strong\u003eRecharge the Beta07 to 80% in 1 hour, power laptops\/phones at 4X speed via USB-C.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTriple Device Charging: \u003c\/strong\u003eDual 18W USB ports + PD45W output fuel 3 gadgets simultaneously. Can be compatible with almost all USB charging devices, such as smartphones, tablets, cameras, and more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnergy Efficient: \u003c\/strong\u003eOutperforms 65W chargers with lower power draw yet equal speed. Supports 1000+ recharge cycles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e600-Lumen Multi-Mode Flashlight — Be Seen, Stay Safe\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra-Bright Lighting: \u003c\/strong\u003e600-lumen flashlight provides a tactical-grade experience with long-range, bright illumination and emergency modes — bring you sense of safety.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFour Lighting Modes: \u003c\/strong\u003eWhite LED flashlight, SOS signal, orange strobe, and warning light — up to 48 hours runtime on a single charge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eLong-lasting Modern Design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLarge Informative Display: \u003c\/strong\u003eFeatures a 3.3 inch high-contrast digital display, easy-to-read even in harsh sunlight. Learn the operational status, battery level and possible errors at a glance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtreme Durability: \u003c\/strong\u003ePerforms reliably from -20°C to 60°C, making it ideal for extreme cold or hot conditions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart and Compact: \u003c\/strong\u003ePalm-sized design (1.5lbs) with intuitive one-button controls, which makes it portable in your car emergency kit, glove box, or even bag. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eComprehensive Safety Features \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta07 Portable Car Jump Starter is very safe and easy to use. The all-metal jumper clamps are designed to be sturdy and durable, it provides versatile protection systems, without the worry of incorrect connections or sparks. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Protection: \u003c\/strong\u003eEquipped with 10 safety layers to guard against reverse polarity, overcurrent, overvoltage, short circuits, and more, ensures risk-free operation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEssential Safety Gear: \u003c\/strong\u003eComes with 400V insulated gloves and a rugged EVA case — perfect for night-time roadside repairs or emergencies.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eWhat You Get\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003eButure Beta07 Jump Starter made of rugged material, waterproof, dustproof and drop-proof, can prevent damage from rain, dust, and external shocks, making it suitable for use in various complex work scenarios. The package includes a Beta07 Jump Starter×1, Heavy Duty Smart Clamp×1, Detachable Air Hose×1, USB\u0026amp;USB-C Charging Cable×2, Insulated Gloves×1, Valve Connectors×3, EVA Protection Case×1, and User Manual×1.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePower Your \"Road Life\": Grab the Buture Beta07 Car Jump Starter — Where Power Meets Precision. Never Fear a Flat Battery or Flat Tire Again! \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46383886860543,"sku":"Beta07","price":129.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/buture-beta07-powerful-car-jump-starter_70d36e9f-a59d-4a49-97ed-986d213391b8.jpg?v=1760337870"},{"product_id":"buture-beta08-jump-starter","title":"Buture Beta08 Car Jump Starter 3000A丨Compact Size, Air Travel Friendly","description":"\u003carticle data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"vBPlN5mreV6Y9OdG\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[\u0026quot;root\u0026quot;,{},[\u0026quot;p\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;uuid\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;m98602v6py7407giese\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;jc\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;justify\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;text\u0026quot;},[\u0026quot;span\u0026quot;,{\u0026quot;data-type\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;leaf\u0026quot;},\u0026quot;Never get stranded again! A flat battery won't slow you down with a reliable car jump 